OL,3,GNEWSACouncil launches review after
OL,4,Aflood barriers not used during Storm
OL,5,ABoelo
OL,6,
OL,7,FRenfrewshire Council will carry out a
OL,8,Ffull review of its flood prevention
OL,9,Farrangements after flood barriers were
OL,10,Fnot used during Storm Boelo.
OL,12,FA report to the local authority
OL,13,Fconfirmed forecasts before the storm
OL,14,F"significantly underestimated tidal
OL,15,Flevels on the River Clyde".
OL,17,FAs a result, no flood warning was
OL,18,Fissued and part of a multi-million
OL,19,Fpound defence scheme was not activated.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
